## Changes made this session

### 1. `server/backend_api.py` (3572 lines total)

Added `knowledge_bp` registration in the `__main__` block (after `timer_bp`):

```python
# Phase 2 / Todo 5 (2026-08-16): register knowledge_bp before running app, so
# /api/knowledge/* endpoints work even though the legacy handlers in this file
# are commented out (they're migrated to server.blueprints.knowledge_bp).
from server.blueprints.knowledge_bp import knowledge_bp  # noqa: E402  late import
app.register_blueprint(knowledge_bp)
```

**Note**: The user's spec mentioned `# === PHASE 2 TODO 5 knowledge ===` marker
style, but the existing Phase 2 BP blocks in this file use the
`# === PHASE 2 TODO N <DOMAIN>_MIGRATION_START/END ===` uppercase convention
(e.g. `TODO 1 STATE_MIGRATION_START`, `TODO 2 SCHEDULE_MIGRATION_START`).
The previous session already adopted the project's convention — preserved.

