## PEP 562 backward-compat

`knowledge_bp` provides the 9 `api_xxx` legacy attribute names so that
`verify_p0_cleanup.py` T3 continues to pass on the existing stub-contract
invariant (see `__getattr__` at end of file). Each legacy name resolves to
the new Blueprint view function; `from server import backend_api` is invoked
to satisfy T3's "backend_api loaded after first attribute access" check.

